Final corrections preserve SavedProjects, old templates without templateTriggers, and trigger-date migration; present malformed trigger fields still fail. Notification entrypoint now checks a successful current load. Supplemental exact-class legacy fixture red three failures then green three passes is not final iOS acceptance.

